60))\\nprint(\\\"Mar 31 2029 weekday\\\", date(2029,3,31).strftime(\\\"%A\\\"), \\\"| Mar 6 2025\\\", date(2025,3,6).strftime(\\\"%A\\\"))\\n\\n# Solicitor math\\nv=385000\\nprint(\\\"385000*1.02^5 =\\\", round(v*1.02**5,2), \\\"stated 425,048\\\")\\nprint(\\\"per MW\\\", round(385000/120,2), \\\"per acre 850\\\", round(385000/850,2), \\\"per fenced acre\\\", round(385000/720,2))\\ntown=[v*1.02**i for i in range(0,10)]+[v*1.02**i for i in range(1,6)]\\nflat=[v]*15\\nprint(\\\"Township Yr11 start Yrs1-15 total\\\", round(sum([v]*10+[v*1.02**i for i in range(1,6)]),2))\\nprint(\\\"Applicant flat total\\\", sum(flat))\\nprint(\\\"Cumulative differential\\\", round(sum([v]*10+[v*1.02**i for i in range(1,6)])-sum(flat),2))\\nprint(\\\"Year16 payment\\\", round(v*1.02,2))\\nPY\"}", "result": "Decision sum 850.0 CoverLetter sum 850\nVariances [40.3, 32.7, 80.4, 3.6, -44.8, -51.1, -61.1] sum 0.0\n620 x 1200 = 744000 | 747600/1200 = 623.0 | 623 x 1200 = 747600\nIf all 850 ac:  1020000 delta vs 747600: 272400\nIf 623+100 statewide: 867600\nnet 6300000 125% 7875000.0 75% of gross 6300000.0 floor ok? True\npanel/fenced coverage % 80.56\n75% of 720 = 540.0\nDC/AC 1.3 BESS MWh 160\ntax total 427000 cost 200\n90 days -> 2025-03-06 Thursday\n30 days -> 2025-01-05 Sunday\n24 months -> Sunday\nlast hearing Oct9 -> 58 days\nNov18 -> Dec6: 18\nDec6 2024 weekday Friday\n60 days pre 2026-04-01 construction: 2026-01-31\n60 days after 2028-12-31: 2029-03-01\nMar 31 2029 weekday Saturday | Mar 6 2025 Thursday\n385000*1.02^5 = 425071.11 stated 425,048\nper MW 3208.33 per acre 850 452.94 per fenced acre 534.72\nTownship Yr11 start Yrs1-15 total 5893626.57\nApplicant flat total 5775000\nCumulative differential 118626.57\nYear16 payment 392700.0\n"}
