ustment (RC-12), the PILOT differential (RC-15) and the hearing-to-decision interval (RC-21).\\\")'''\\nnew2 = '''_rc = Counter(r['result'] for r in CF.RECALC)\\n_dm = [r['id'] for r in CF.RECALC if r['result']=='Does not match']\\nbody(doc, f\\\"**Summary of the recomputation results.** {_rc['Match']} items reconcile exactly. {_rc['Does not match']} do not reconcile at all: the parcel-by-parcel schedules (RC-03), the agricultural mitigation acreage (RC-04), the lot-coverage computation (RC-10), the first annual reporting date (RC-14) and the Township Solicitor's escalation figure (RC-16). {_rc['Flag']} are flagged for legal, schedule or valuation significance even though the arithmetic is right — in particular the permit expiry (RC-13), the appeal-date business-day adjustment (RC-12), the PILOT differential (RC-15) and the hearing-to-decision interval (RC-21).\\\")'''\\nassert old2 in s; s = s.replace(old2, new2)\\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print(\\\"ok\\\")\\nPY\\ncd $WORKSPACE_DIR && python3 build/build_docx.py && soffice --headless --convert-to pdf --outdir render output/compliance-tracking-matrix.docx >/dev/null 2>&1 && pdfinfo render/compliance-tracking-matrix.pdf | grep Pages\\nfor i in $(seq 1 40); do t=$(pdftotext -f $i -l $i -layout render/compliance-tracking-matrix.pdf - 2>/dev/null | grep -iE \\\"^(PART [0-9] —|APPENDIX [ABC] —)\\\" | head -1); [ -n \\\"$t\\\" ] && echo \\\"p$i: $t\\\"; done\"}"}], "input_tokens": 197065, "output_tokens": 1650, "finish_reason": "completed"}
