ter fencing and wildlife openings                              A-12a, A-13                              Open (pre-permit gate)\nCond 16          Vegetative screening buffer                                          A-17a, A-17e, A-17f                              Conflict\nCond 17          Lighting standards                                                   A-20                                       Open (no evidence)\nCond 18          Noise limit and compliance measurement                               B-13a, E-05                                      Conflict\nCond 19          Solar glare analysis                                                 B-14                                     Open (pre-permit gate)\nCond 20          FAA determination                                                    A-21                                               N/A\nCond 21          Decommissioning plan and timetable                                   D-01                                             Conflict\nCond 22          Decommissioning security                                             D-02, D-03                                       Conflict\nCond 23          Five-yearly cost estimate updates                                    D-04                                             Conflict\nCond 24          Decommissioning trigger and abandonment                              D-05                                             Conflict\nCond 25          Road maintenance bond                                                C-05                                             Conflict\nCond 26          Pre- and post-construction road surveys                              A-23                                     Open (pre-permit gate)\nCond 27          Construction traffic plan and hours                                  A-19, C-06                               Open (pre-permit gate)\nCond 28          Agricultural mitigation payment                                      B-10                                             Conflict\nCond 29          School district taxes                                                D-07                                        Satisfied (record)\nCond 30          PILOT agreement                                                      D-06                                     Open (pre-permit gate)\nCond 31          Maintenance obligations                                              E-01                                       Open (no evidence)\nCond 32          Annual compliance report                                             E-02                                             Conflict\nCond 33          Emergency response plan and exercises                                C-03, E-07                                 Open (no evidence)\nCond 34          Timing of financial assurances                                       D-08                                             Conflict\nCond 35          Modification and amendment                                           F-05                                             Conflict\n\fAPPENDIX B — DEFINED TERMS AND ABBREVIATIONS\nTerm                          Meaning in this document\nBESS                          Battery energy storage system; here 40 MW / 160 MWh lithium-ion, proposed as an\n                              accessory use.\nCOD                           Commercial Operation Date — the date the facility first delivers energy for commercial\n                              sale, as certified by the operator and confirmed by the RTO. Projected 31 December\n                              2027 (D&O s.II).\nCondition / Cond              A numbered condition of approval in Section VI of the Decision and Order (1 to 35).\nConservation District         Lancaster County Conservation District — approves the E&S plan and reviews the\n                              stormwater plan before the Township Engineer may accept it (Condition 11).\nCU approval                   Conditional use approval granted